{
  "description": "Test fixture manifest documenting expected properties for each PDF file. Used by unit and property-based tests to verify correct behavior. Every entry describes what the current binary returns; a deliberate behaviour change shows up as a diff of this file.",
  "conventions": {
    "decodedStreamLength": "byte length of getImageStreamData(); null means the call fails (qpdf cannot decode the filter chain) and never returns undecoded bytes",
    "rawStreamLength": "byte length of getRawImageStreamData(); null when it depends on the zlib implementation (Flate-encoded payloads)",
    "order": "expectedImages are listed in ascending (objId, generation) order, which is the order getImages() returns (since 0.3.0)",
    "lookup": "colorSpaceInfo.lookup is a plain number array here; the library returns a Uint8Array",
    "encoding": "readImage(): `encoding` and `encodedLength` (bytes after container filters are removed); encoding null means readImage fails for that image",
    "pageInfos": "getPageInfo(i) for every page; a missing /MediaBox is reported as qpdf repairs it (Letter)"
  },
